          "covered": "One IF _N_=1 THEN SET lookup before a driving SET reads the first lookup row once. Lookup/input variables retain current values until overwritten; numeric RETAIN initializes once, ordinary scratch variables reset per input iteration. The composed original program emits five snapshots from three WHERE-selected rows, with scratch missing after the first row.",
